{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#889","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#889","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#889\",\"parent_revision\":\"cc13a7ff8e2f6757bb77c2510691d8831fa420e78d636100d03000e651e0718e\",\"root_revision\":\"cc13a7ff8e2f6757bb77c2510691d8831fa420e78d636100d03000e651e0718e\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nImplement the `PreToolUse` Claude Code hook that fires on every pilot tool call, calls `vm_steering_check`, and injects any pending steering message as a system instruction via `hookSpecificOutput`. The pilot acknowledges via `vm_steering_ack`. This is the fallback path for environments where MCP Channels are not available.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **pretooluse hook \u2014 hook-based radio steering injection** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: PRD-vm-flightsimulator-v2\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-20\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"688fc806e0dc3ecd91b5adf690df3b9fae4b7801df75bc4b127a24721d7c8c55\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVDCHfQ\"}"}